{title: Hai Apna Dil To Awara}
{artist: Hemant Kumar S D Burman}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] [A],        Hai apna dil to awara
[G] [A] [D],        Naa jaane kis pe aayega
[D],        Haseeno ne bulaya
[D],        Gale se bhi lagaya
[G],        Bohat samjhaya,
[A],        yehi na samjha
[D] [A],        Bohat bhola hai bechara
[G] [A] [D],        Na jaane kis pe aayega
[D],        Ajab hai deewana
[D],        Naa dar naa thikana
[G],        Zameen se begana
[A],        Falak se judaa
[D] [A],        Yeh ik toota hua taara
[G] [A] [D],        Naa jaane kis pe aayega
[D],        Zamana dekha saara,
[D],        hai sabka sahara
[G],        Yeh dil hi humara,
[A],        hua na kisi ka
[D] [A],        Safar mein hai yeh banjara
[G] [A] [D],        Naa jaane kis pe aayega
